 "source_instruction": "i would like a pair of small blue shorts made of nylon spandex.",
 "query": "I was walking over from the parking lot a few minutes ago and stopped to watch a group of kids chasing a very fluffy golden retriever that had gotten loose with a whole half-eaten popsicle clamped in its mouth, and it was zigzagging between picnic tables near the mall entrance like it knew exactly how much fun everyone was having watching it. One of the kids was wearing sparkly rain boots even though it hasn\u2019t rained in three days, and they kept skidding a little on the warm concrete every time the dog darted in a new direction, laughing so hard they could barely keep their balance. A food truck parked by the sidewalk was grilling something that smelled like garlic and lime, and the person working the window handed out a free tiny cup of mango salsa to every person who stopped to watch the silly chase, even me, and it was so bright and tangy it made my eyes water a little in the best way. Right now I\u2019m looking through the women\u2019s shorts section, and I\u2019ve heard the pairs made of that stretchy nylon spandex blend work really well, right? I\u2019ve heard the small size of that cool one fits how I like my shorts to fit, too. I\u2019ve also heard those options don\u2019t cost too much, and I\u2019ve heard sticking to my budget works out best for me right now, yeah?",
